  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO  COMPUTER AND COMPUTING",
    "describe_ch": "瞭解計算機組織原理、基本軟硬體的架構與應用及IT相關技術。內容包含計算機硬體結構、數字系統與數位邏輯觀念；介紹作業系統及其指令操作; 資料結構與程式語言；各種應用軟體的介紹與使用；電腦網路與網際網路原理與應用；及最新的IT技術。",
    "describe_eh": "TGoal of this course is to enable students to understand the principles of computer organization, basic software and hardware architecture, the latest IT applications and related technology. Includes computer hardware architecture, digital systems and digital logic concepts, the operating system and instructions operation, data structure and programming language; introduce the different applications software, computer network and Internet principles and applications, the latest Information technology.",
