    "tpa_score_new": "<div>\n<div>Letter or Numerical grades based on homework and exam scores, weighted as follows:&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&bull;&nbsp; Class participation&nbsp; 40%</div>\n\n<div>&bull;&nbsp; Midterm exam&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 30%&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&bull;&nbsp; Final exam&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;30%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Any cheating on requirements will result in a grade of F.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>Letter or Numerical grades based on homework and exam scores, weighted as follows:</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&bull;&nbsp; Class participation&nbsp; 40%</div>\n\n<div>&bull;&nbsp; Midterm exam&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 30%&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&bull;&nbsp; Final exam&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;30%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Any cheating on requirements will result in a grade of F.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "課堂規則\n上課期間，學生不得\n- 進行交談；\n- 使用與課堂學習無關之電子產品；\n- 破壞秩序；\n- 飲食（盡量在課前/後用畢）。\n\n- 無線通信裝置（手機、手錶、平板電腦等）必須保持靜音。\n- 課堂上禁止穿涼鞋或拖鞋。",
    "course_pol_en": "During lecture, students may not\n- hold conversations;\n- use mobile device that is irrelevant to classroom learning;\n- engage in disruptive behavior;\n- eat food.\n\n- Wireless communications devices must be silenced. \n- No sandals or slippers.\n\n\n課堂規則\n上課期間，學生不得\n- 進行交談；\n- 使用與課堂學習無關之電子產品；\n- 破壞秩序；\n- 飲食（盡量在課前/後用畢）。\n\n- 無線通信裝置（手機、手錶、平板電腦等）必須保持靜音。\n- 課堂上禁止穿涼鞋或拖鞋。",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": "During lecture, students may not \n- hold conversations;\n- use mobile device that is irrelevant to classroom learning;\n- engage in disruptive behavior;\n- eat food (finish eating before or after class).",
    "ais_meno": "<div>為建立正確學術誠信觀念及了解現今生成式人工智慧工具(例如：ChatGPT等)利用於教學、研究、論文撰寫等之規範準則，學生可至「<a href=\"https://ethics.moe.edu.tw/\">教育部臺灣學術倫理教育資源中心</a>」註冊上課，亦請參閱「<a href=\"https://www.ust.edu.tw/News_Detailed.aspx?GUID=47953900-3006-4521-85c8-70abaf17e584\"><strong>臺灣研究誠信守則</strong></a>」之詳細說明。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>為建立正確學術誠信觀念及了解其規範準則，學生可至「<a href=\"https://ethics.moe.edu.tw/\">教育部臺灣學術倫理教育資源中心</a>」註冊上課，亦請參閱「<a href=\"https://www.ust.edu.tw/News_Detailed.aspx?GUID=47953900-3006-4521-85c8-70abaf17e584\"><strong>臺灣研究誠信守則</strong></a>」之詳細說明。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>You are encouraged to work and study with your classmates. However, any work you submit for homework or exams must be your own work. Those found cheating on any assignment or test will automatically fail this course.</div>\n",
